yer base with no soul.\nGood game are made by good game developers and a good player base with a good soul.\nso enjoy this Gorilla Tag Fan game.-Moose.", "short_description": "Planet Of Monkey VR isn't the new flashy vr game.\nIt isn't the new Gorilla Tag.\nIt is a simple monkey game to enjoy and play, just like gorilla tag was in 2021.\nGames aren't poular games aren't truly good when they are made by a big company with a player base with no soul.\nGood game are made by good game developers and a good player base with a good soul.\nso enjoy this Gorilla Tag Fan game-Moose."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/planetofmonkeyvrprivacypolicyi/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MooseGameDevelopment", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/planet-of-monkey-vr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26397169946547281"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308699_3400379493471936_1399537663054445829_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tfA9pct0HgcQ7kNvwGNgaoX&_nc_oc=AdmaFSHqTo4LNQCqtGmKPOafDRxpqqBgYA08EL0cXYWb1ezBzrtNDDwkrdWFViskp88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwzPJw5NR9Hq